+**Superseded details in my earlier record:** "both smoke tests fail"; digest `ee172746…`; and the
+"measured UNAVAILABLE / configured-only" envelope framing.
+
+**Re-verified by me at 09:06Z on the exact current bytes:** both
+`knowledge-free-dispatch-smoke.sh` and `knowledge-act34-adaptive-smoke.sh` exit 0; the current
+negative-acceptance digest is
+`262c84136cc8742f2c92e4a70b9264ea89b4aee0db6f15ab67ac6b47589a112d`. No actual four-office
+execution exists, but a proxy-p95 envelope is measured: per office 11,320,103 accounting tokens,
